{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30869","headline":"送册东夷王使 · 马戴","name":"送册东夷王使","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"越海传金册，华夷礼命行。\n片帆秋色动，万里信潮生。\n日映孤舟出，沙连绝岛明。\n翳空翻大鸟，飞雪洒长鲸。\n旧鬓回应改，遐荒梦易惊。\n何当理风檝，天外问来程。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"马戴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30869.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30869","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}